      "writtenOn": "2018-01-26T20:42:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This seems a slightly odd example - and one that seems the outlier to the normal case when Jane tries to locate the 21st cpu and is denied. Use Kelly might then raise the limit to 25, or advice Jane to delete some cpus that are already in use.\n\nWas there a reason to show this particular corner case?",
