        "id": 5046
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-01-26T22:12:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the main purpose of this case is that it highlights the different between limits and usage. At least that\u0027s how it seemed to be relaying in the specification:\n\nhttp://specs.openstack.org/openstack/keystone-specs/specs/keystone/ongoing/unified-limits.html#limits-vs-usage-enforcement\n\nI think that it does a good job of showcasing that changing the limit doesn\u0027t result in the reaping of resources instantaneously. Which was an interesting ah-ha moment for me at least. I can add another example.",
